{"mode": "replace", "new_string": "He had the right answer on his tongue — a polished line from pre-launch media training about writing a book and giving lectures. What he wanted to say was different.", "old_string": "Gabriel opened his mouth and closed it. He had a practiced answer for this question — he had given it at the press conference before launch, in the polished language of astronaut-candidate media training. He was going to write a book. He was going to give lectures. He was going to preserve the record of the mission for the people who would come after.

